#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:9
msgid "Developer experience and provider iteration"
msgstr "开发体验与 provider 迭代"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:11
msgid ""
"Current iteration uses one F4 production support package, static typed "
"factory and explicit ownership. Historical work-package ledgers retain "
"original identities at the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design), without"
" becoming current completion percentages or support catalogues."
msgstr ""
"当前迭代采用一个 F4 生产支持包、静态类型化 factory "
"和显式所有权。历史工作包台账在[固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design)保留原始身份，不转化为当前完成率或支持目录。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:16
msgid "Boundaries that stay explicit"
msgstr "保持明确的边界"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:18
msgid ""
"The current [architecture diagram](../explanation/platform-architecture.md) "
"still applies. One product TOML becomes immutable typed IR and exact static "
"instances; CMake selects sources. Factory getters return existing readonly "
"faces. Products own execution, storage, private PCB and recovery policy "
"outside this repository. A friendlier command does not create a second "
"configuration or build authority."
msgstr ""
"当前[架构图](../explanation/platform-architecture.md)仍然适用。一份产品 TOML 生成不可变 typed IR"
" 和精确静态实例；CMake 选择源码。factory getter 返回已有只读 face。产品在本仓库之外拥有执行、存储、私有 PCB "
"与恢复策略。更易用的命令不建立第二份配置或构建权威。"

