msgstr "耗时记录保留未知项和失败；删除测试必须保留独立覆盖"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:0
msgid "W9: external integration"
msgstr "W9：外部集成"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:0
msgid "Actual examples applications, source lock and public SDK consumption"
msgstr "真实示例应用、源码锁与公共 SDK 消费"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:0
msgid "Platform P and examples E are fixed in the final delivery association"
msgstr "平台 P 与示例 E 在最终交付关联中固定"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:36
msgid "Source ownership and migration"
msgstr "源码归属与迁移"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:38
msgid ""
"Private MCU IP belongs inside `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`. Board and SoC inputs are "
"readonly facts; centralized host generation remains separate from firmware C."
" Native fixtures require explicit test support. See the [source "
"map](../explanation/source-map.md) and [official-library contract](official-"
"stm32-provider.md) for current boundaries."
msgstr ""
"私有 MCU IP 归入 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`。Board 和 SoC 输入为只读事实，集中主机生成与固件 C 分开。Native "
"fixture 必须显式启用测试支持。当前边界见[源码地图](../explanation/source-"
"map.md)和[官方库合同](official-stm32-provider.md)。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:43
msgid ""
"`explain` prints a human summary by default; automation uses `--json`. "
"Friendlier tools do not add a second configuration authority, hidden "
"executor, global device registry or permission to release borrowed storage. "
"Source-bound software results and physical execution retain separate exits."
msgstr ""
"`explain` 默认输出可读摘要，自动化使用 "
"`--json`。更易用的工具不增加第二份配置权威、隐藏执行器、全局设备注册表或释放借用存储的权限。绑定源码的软件结果和物理执行保留各自退出条件。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:48
msgid "Close work with observations"
msgstr "以实际观察关闭任务"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:50
msgid "Compare complete execution costs"
msgstr "比较完整执行成本"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:52
msgid ""
"The ordinary behavioral TDD gate first runs the maintained `python "
"tools/dev/dev.py doctor --target contracts` profile. It checks prepared, "
"locked Native/ARM tools before expensive Python and Native suites, without "
"installing tools or requiring Docker. Documentation-only staged changes "
"retain the existing fast path. This preflight neither replaces tests nor "
"establishes software qualification."
msgstr ""
"普通行为变更的 TDD 门禁首先运行维护的 `python tools/dev/dev.py doctor --target contracts` "
"profile。在昂贵的 Python 和 Native suite 之前，检查已准备且锁定的 Native/ARM 工具，不安装工具，也不要求 "
"Docker。仅文档的暂存变更沿用现有快速路径。此预检不代替测试，也不建立软件资格。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:59
msgid ""
"Use `dev.py timings --compare` only after two independent complete executions"
" of the same maintained formal plan, clean source and dependency pins. Each "
"execution must bind the same verified OCI environment-report bytes using the "
"optional `qualify --environment` input. That binding records observed input "
"identity; it does not prove that checkers ran inside an isolated container. "
"Historical reports without this original binding remain valid for their own "
"executed scope, but cannot be retrofitted into this comparison."
msgstr ""
"只有在相同维护的正式计划、clean 源码和固定依赖上完成两次独立的完整执行后，才使用 `dev.py timings "
"--compare`。每次执行必须通过可选的 `qualify --environment` 输入，绑定相同且已验证的 OCI environment-"
"report 字节。该绑定记录已观察的输入身份，不证明 checker "
"在隔离容器中运行。缺少这种原始绑定的历史报告仍保留其原执行范围的有效性，但不能事后补入本比较。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:67
msgid ""
"From the clean platform root, set `NEXUS_MEASUREMENT_ROOT` to a new output "
"parent with adequate capacity, `NEXUS_ENVIRONMENT` to the sealed OCI layout's"
" `environment.json`, and `NEXUS_COLD_CACHE_STATE`/`NEXUS_WARM_CACHE_STATE` to"
" the actual cache preparation descriptions. Prepare the intended cold and "
"warm conditions explicitly before their respective executions. These commands"
" run the complete plan; they do not reuse existing successful test reports:"
msgstr ""
"从 clean 平台根目录执行：将 `NEXUS_MEASUREMENT_ROOT` 设置为容量充足的新输出父目录，将 "
"`NEXUS_ENVIRONMENT` 设置为封存 OCI layout 的 `environment.json`，并将 "
"`NEXUS_COLD_CACHE_STATE`/`NEXUS_WARM_CACHE_STATE` 设置为实际缓存准备说明。在每次执行前显式准备相应 "
"cold 或 warm 条件。以下命令运行完整计划，不复用已有的成功测试报告："

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:90
msgid ""
"Both runs must actually complete successfully with the exact plan, stage "
"order, commands, raw streams and independent receipts. Formal plans disable "
"compiler cache; declaring warm preparation does not enable it. The comparison"
" reports the union of original stage-command wall intervals, excluding idle "
"gaps and avoiding nested wall-time sums. Native producer checks additionally "
"validate the current shared build outputs; they do not establish independent "
"historical inner Native XML/artifacts for each cold/warm run. Cache state is "
"declared, not measured cache hits; aggregate CPU, process-tree peak RSS and "
"their deltas remain unknown. A cost comparison is not qualification and "
"cannot qualify changed source. No complete cold/warm measurement is claimed "
"merely because this command exists."
msgstr ""
"两次执行都必须实际完整成功，且计划、阶段顺序、命令、原始输出流和独立 receipt 精确匹配。正式计划禁用编译器缓存；声明 warm "
"准备不会启用它。比较报告使用原始阶段命令墙钟区间的并集，排除空闲间隔并避免嵌套墙钟时长相加。Native producer "
"检查还验证当前共享构建输出，不证明每次 cold/warm 执行分别保留独立历史内部 Native XML/产物。缓存状态是声明，不是测得的 cache "
"hit；汇总 CPU、进程树峰值 RSS 及相应差值仍为未知。成本比较不是资格，不能赋予变更后源码资格。命令存在本身不表示完整 cold/warm "
"测量已执行。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:102
msgid "Hand off an unsigned local software preview"
msgstr "交接无签名的本地软件预览"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:104
msgid ""
"When hosted Actions is unavailable, the explicit `prepare-local` command "
"(`bundle-local` alias) in `tools/release/delivery.py` assembles a local "
"preview from original complete software execution, SDK/consumer packages, "
"documentation and sealed candidates. `verify-local` independently checks the "
"prepared output. Use the [local preview contract and exact "
"commands](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#explicit-local-software-preview) with a new "
"output directory and the expected clean source commit. Input sources, "
"dependency pins, original completed receipts, SDK identity and "
"candidate/document scope must agree; successful reports are not reused to "
"qualify another source."
msgstr ""
"托管 Actions 不可用时，`tools/release/delivery.py` 中显式的 `prepare-local` 命令（别名 "
"`bundle-local`）从原始完整软件执行、SDK/consumer 包、文档与封存候选装配本地预览。`verify-local` "
"独立检查准备后的输出。使用[本地预览合同与精确命令](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#explicit-local-software-"
"preview)，选用新输出目录和预期 clean 源码提交。输入源码、固定依赖、原始已结束 receipt、SDK 身份与 "
"candidate/document 范围必须一致；成功报告不复用为其他源码的资格。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:113
msgid ""
"This path preserves original bytes and restores packages without rebuilding "
"or resealing them. Its trust is `local_observation_no_oidc`, signature status"
" is unsigned and `publication_authorized=false`. It does not fabricate "
"Actions runs, OIDC or a formal release, and it does not weaken the existing "
"publication guards. Actual remote publication remains a separate exit."
msgstr ""
"该路径保留原始字节，恢复包时不重建或重新封存。其 trust 为 `local_observation_no_oidc`，签名状态为 unsigned，且"
" `publication_authorized=false`。它不伪造 Actions run、OIDC 或正式 "
"release，不削弱现有发布门禁。实际远程发布仍是独立退出。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:119
msgid ""
"The ledger records actual implementation and evidence paths, including "
"limited development tests. The {download}`development result index "
"<../delivery/developer-experience-results.json>` keeps maintained test entry "
"points and observed scope; final PR/CI association is recorded after source "
"commits exist. Final source gates, independent SDK consumption and bilingual "
"documentation have separate integration exits. Do not turn an expected CI "
"run, a template manifest or an old release result into a passed current-"
"source exit."
msgstr ""
"台账记录实际实现与证据路径，包括范围有限的开发测试。{download}`开发结果索引 <../delivery/developer-"
"experience-results.json>` 保留已维护测试入口和观察范围；最终 PR／CI 关联在源码提交产生后记录。最终源码门禁、独立 SDK "
"消费与双语文档各有集成退出条件。预期的 CI 运行、模板 manifest 或旧版本结果都不能冒充当前源码的通过结果。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:126
msgid ""
"Platform commit P is created before examples lock and gitlink are updated to "
"P. Examples commit E is then recorded with P by the delivery association. "
"Tutorials use an explicit examples-revision variable supplied by that record;"
" neither repository embeds the other repository's future commit. Normal "
"review and publication controls remain in effect."
msgstr ""
"先创建平台提交 P，再将示例源码锁和 gitlink 更新为 P。随后在交付关联中记录示例提交 E 与 "
"P。教程使用该记录提供的显式示例版本变量；两个仓库都不嵌入对方尚未产生的提交。正常评审与发布控制继续生效。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:132
msgid ""
"No physical station is connected for this iteration. H1–H6 remain "
"`not_executed`: launch-board bring-up and tools; serial/SPI/I2C and recovery;"
" IRQ/critical-section latency; continuous DMA/Cache; Flash/watchdog/shutdown;"
" and final physical support sealing. Prepared plans preserve unknown PCB "
"facts, station identity and numeric acceptance limits for later real "
"execution."
msgstr ""
"本轮未连接物理测试站。H1–H6 保持 `not_executed`：首发板启动与工具；串口／SPI／I2C 与恢复；IRQ／临界区延迟；连续 "
"DMA／Cache；Flash／看门狗／停机；最终物理支持范围封存。准备的计划为以后真实执行保留未知 PCB 事实、测试站身份与数值验收限值。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:138
msgid "Exact Qiming Board integration"
msgstr "启明开发板的精确接入"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:140
msgid ""
"QB01–QB32 extend the same execution ledger for the supplied STM32F407ZGT6 "
"core schematic and high-configuration V4.1 schematic. The earlier 107 rows "
"retain their original identities and exits. This is a complete work "
"breakdown, not a claim that every new driver or physical exit has passed. "
"Read each row's implementation, software and hardware columns separately."
msgstr ""
"QB01–QB32 在同一执行台账中追加所提供 STM32F407ZGT6 核心板原理图与高配 V4.1 原理图的接入任务。此前 107 "
"行保留原编号和退出条件。这是一份完整的工作分解，不表示每个新驱动或物理退出条件均已通过。每行的实现、软件和硬件状态须分别阅读。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:146
msgid ""
"Both drawings contain their own MCU, power and clocks. They describe "
"independent Boards; a plug-compatible core/carrier relationship has not been "
"established. `stm32f407zg-qiming-core` and `stm32f407zg-qiming-v41` therefore"
" have separate packages. The original `stm32f407zg-qiming-v31` identity "
"remains unchanged. PDF revision and document date are source identities; "
"physical PCB revision stays unknown until inspected."
msgstr ""
"两份图纸各自包含 MCU、电源和时钟，描述的是两块独立开发板，尚未证明核心板与底板可直接配插。因此，`stm32f407zg-qiming-core` 与"
" `stm32f407zg-qiming-v41` 使用独立板卡包。原有 `stm32f407zg-qiming-v31` 身份保持不变。PDF "
"版本和文档日期仅标识资料来源，实际 PCB 修订在检查前继续为未知。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:153
msgid ""
"The user confirmed ILI9341 and XPT2046, with a 16-bit display and matching "
"touch connector. The core drawing marks SRAM, NOR and the backup battery "
"unpopulated. The V4.1 drawing contains a conflicting W25Q128/64-Mbit "
"annotation. A declared device choice must be checked against the selected "
"device identity and geometry; the implementation must not silently choose a "
"different part. The exact audio and camera modules still require selection "
"before their physical support is claimed."
msgstr ""
"用户已确认 ILI9341 和 XPT2046，对应 16 位显示总线及匹配的触摸接口。核心板图纸将 SRAM、NOR 与后备电池标为空贴。V4.1 "
"图纸存在 W25Q128 与 64-Mbit "
"标注冲突。声明的器件选型必须与选中器件的身份和几何参数核对，实现不能静默改用另一型号。音频与摄像头模块仍须明确选型，才能声明其物理支持。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:161
msgid "Configuration and runtime responsibilities"
msgstr "配置与运行时职责"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:163
msgid ""
"The [existing static architecture](../explanation/platform-architecture.md) "
"remains the runtime boundary. One authored TOML selects exact SoC, Board and "
"reviewed hardware choices. Immutable typed IR generates only static data, "
"storage, faces, factory accessors and fixed call ordering. Hardware "
"admission, register operations, waiting, rollback and withdrawal remain C11. "
"CMake owns selected source dependencies; no runtime registry, object pool, "
"mandatory worker or additional per-byte forwarding layer is introduced."
msgstr ""
"[既有静态架构](../explanation/platform-architecture.md)继续界定运行时边界。一份 authored TOML "
"选择精确 SoC、Board 和已审硬件选项。不可变 typed IR 只生成静态配置数据、存储、接口对象、factory "
"访问器和固定调用顺序。硬件准入、寄存器操作、等待、回滚及归还仍由 C11 实现。CMake "
"拥有所选源码依赖；不增加运行时注册表、对象池、强制工作线程或额外的逐字节转发层。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:171
msgid ""
"Board `hardware_options` declares allowed choices without defaults. A "
"binding's `requires` conditions must match explicit TOML `[hardware]` "
"selections. Missing population or jumper choices cannot be repaired by the "
"resolver. These are reviewed declarations, not physical inspection evidence. "
"Electrical requirements such as input pull-up, inactive CS, RS485 direction "
"and backlight polarity must also be validated and executed; a text `unknowns`"
" entry cannot perform admission."
msgstr ""
"Board 的 `hardware_options` 声明允许的选项，不提供默认值。绑定的 `requires` 条件必须匹配 TOML 中显式的 "
"`[hardware]` 选择。解析器不能补齐缺失的器件安装或跳线选择。这些是已审声明，并非实物检查证据。输入上拉、CS 非活动电平、RS485 "
"方向和背光极性等电气要求也必须经过校验并实际执行；`unknowns` 文本不能执行准入。"

