#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:189
msgid ""
"UART integration uses reviewed controller/pad/IRQ/APB facts instead of "
"inferring every port from USART1. All six serial instances need actual "
"selected-mode validation. Adding a controller must not advertise DMA or "
"alternate pins that have not been implemented. GPIO electrical fields and "
"EXTI line/vector ownership must agree with generated configuration and the "
"real provider."
msgstr ""
"UART 接入依据已审控制器、焊盘、IRQ 和 APB 事实，不再从 USART1 "
"推断所有端口。六个串口实例都需要验证其实际选定模式。新增控制器不能宣称尚未实现的 DMA 或备用引脚。GPIO 电气字段、EXTI "
"线与中断向量所有权必须与生成配置及真实 provider 一致。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:195
msgid ""
"FSMC has one shared bus owner and independent bank configuration. SRAM uses "
"NE3 and the display uses NE4; their common pads and gate cannot be "
"independently restored by two providers. The following describes software "
"ownership, not physical memory or timing qualification:"
msgstr ""
"FSMC 具有一个共享总线 owner 和独立存储区配置。SRAM 使用 NE3，显示使用 NE4；两个 provider "
"不能各自恢复公共焊盘与门控。下图描述软件所有权，不代表物理存储器或时序资格："

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:213
msgid ""
"External `.data` or `.bss` requires internal Flash/MSP bootstrap, FSMC "
"admission and bank initialization before C runtime first accesses those "
"regions. A post-start memory window does not establish that support. A bank "
"backing live globals or stack cannot be withdrawn by ordinary Platform stop. "
"Its retained effect must prevent clock/pad withdrawal until reset or an "
"explicit valid quiescence contract. CPU reachability and each DMA master's "
"reachability are reviewed independently; CCM stays excluded from peripheral "
"DMA."
msgstr ""
"外部 `.data` 或 `.bss` 要求使用内部 Flash/MSP 完成引导，在 C 运行时首次访问对应区域前完成 FSMC "
"准入和存储区初始化。启动后的内存窗口不能证明具备此能力。承载活跃全局变量或栈的存储区不能由普通 Platform stop "
"撤回。其保留效果必须阻止时钟和焊盘归还，直到复位或满足显式有效的静止合同。CPU 可达性与每个 DMA master 的可达性须分别评审；CCM "
"仍不允许外设 DMA 访问。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:221
msgid ""
"`cpu-window` and `startup-memory` are explicit alternatives. Startup memory "
"uses the existing ADDSRAM placement attributes and a separate immutable "
"external memory record, without changing the chip's internal RAM facts. Its "
"permanent receipt exists before `Platform.start()`: factory lookup, early "
"startup refusal or failed runtime adoption cannot report a clean global stop."
" The selected reset path requires internal MSP of at least 512 bytes and "
"currently admits the five non-LTO optimization profiles. Freestanding ARM "
"analysis bounds their reset call chains by 304 bytes; this is static software"
" evidence, not a measured stack peak. LTO, warm handoff, offset images, "
"external code/stack/heap and DMA access remain outside this startup profile."
msgstr ""
"`cpu-window` 与 `startup-memory` 是显式互斥的用途。启动内存使用已有 ADDSRAM "
"放置属性和独立的不可变外部内存记录，不修改芯片内部 RAM 事实。其持续资源占用记录早于 `Platform.start()` 存在；仅查找 "
"factory、早期启动拒绝或运行期接管失败，都不能据此将全局停机报告为干净完成。所选复位路径要求至少 512 字节内部 MSP，目前准入五种非 LTO "
"优化配置。freestanding ARM 静态分析将这些配置的复位调用链限定为 304 "
"字节；这是静态软件证据，不是实测栈峰值。LTO、热交接、偏移镜像、外部代码/栈/heap 及 DMA 访问均不在此启动配置范围内。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:232
msgid ""
"ILI9341 transfers use the actual 16-bit bus and command/data address "
"selection. The shared MCU NRST connection is not an independent display reset"
" GPIO. XPT2046 uses PA5/PB1/PB2/PB0 and PF11; that combination is not a "
"hardware SPI route. Its optional software SPI port must bound transactions "
"and timing without long global interrupt masking. A failed idle-pin "
"withdrawal ends CPU buffer access but retains bus recovery responsibility; it"
" cannot report successful CS release. Raw touch does not include product "
"calibration or filtering policy."
msgstr ""
"ILI9341 传输使用实际 16 位总线及命令/数据地址选择。与 MCU 共用的 NRST 连接不是独立显示复位 GPIO。XPT2046 使用 "
"PA5/PB1/PB2/PB0 和 PF11，此组合不是硬件 SPI 路由。可选软件 SPI "
"端口必须限制事务长度和时序，不能长时间全局屏蔽中断。空闲引脚归还失败时，CPU 缓冲区访问结束，但总线恢复责任继续保留，不能报告 CS "
"已成功释放。原始触摸不包含产品校准或滤波策略。"

