#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:252
msgid ""
"The official locked STM32F4 HAL/LL is preferred where the complete selected "
"mode satisfies the Nexus contract. It does not start global HAL "
"initialization or replace the existing time domain with SysTick. Private "
"callbacks, vendor waits, error drain and source withdrawal still require "
"explicit review. F407 has no data cache; an H7 cache contract must not be "
"copied into this Board profile."
msgstr ""
"当完整选定模式满足 Nexus 合同时，优先复用已锁定的官方 STM32F4 HAL/LL。接入不执行全局 HAL 初始化，也不以 SysTick "
"替换现有时间域。私有回调、厂商等待、错误排空和来源归还仍须明确评审。F407 没有数据缓存，不能将 H7 的缓存合同直接套用到此 Board 配置。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:258
msgid ""
"The selected SDIO implementation is synchronous CPU polling. Platform startup"
" prepares the socket; explicit activation identifies a card and publishes its"
" 512-byte sector geometry. Every return ends CPU payload access, while "
"uncertain card programming can independently keep the controller, pins and "
"gate owned. DMA, IRQ, hot-swap, physical card detection and a filesystem are "
"not provided by this mode. RTC likewise separates explicit retained-calendar "
"adoption from empty-backup provisioning with an authored initial date; "
"provisioning never invents a default calendar or resets the backup domain."
msgstr ""
"选定的 SDIO 实现采用同步 CPU 轮询。Platform 启动只准备卡座，应用显式激活后才识别卡并发布 512 字节扇区几何。每次返回均结束 CPU"
" 对载荷的访问，但卡编程结果不确定时，控制器、引脚和门控可以独立保留所有权。此模式不提供 DMA、IRQ、热插拔、物理卡检测或文件系统。RTC "
"同样区分显式的保留日历接管与空后备域配置；后者必须提供 authored 初始日期，既不虚构默认日历，也不复位后备域。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:267
msgid ""
"Public RS485 composition obtains the transport with `nx_factory_uart_ref()` "
"and its existing TX admission callback with "
"`nx_factory_uart_tx_validator_ref()`, using the same exact `nx_uart_ref_t`. "
"The getter is a pure lookup: it neither changes instance state nor adds "
"vtable fields, and unreviewed modes or IDs return NULL. The caller pairs that"
" callback with the same UART context and supplies the DE GPIO and setup/hold "
"budget to the existing RS485 adapter through public headers. This pairing is "
"a caller precondition, not runtime authentication. The actual C11 ARM "
"consumer retains the selected UART/GPIO providers and adapter; it does not "
"establish physical bus timing. RS232 acceptance and the drawn MAX485/MAX232 "
"supplies or actual substitute parts still require verification."
msgstr ""
"公共 RS485 装配使用同一个精确的 `nx_uart_ref_t`，通过 `nx_factory_uart_ref()` 取得传输接口，通过 "
"`nx_factory_uart_tx_validator_ref()` 取得其已有 TX 准入回调。getter 仅执行查找，不修改实例状态、不增加 "
"vtable 字段；未经评审的模式或 ID 返回 NULL。调用者将回调与同一 UART context 配对，并通过公共头文件向既有 RS485 "
"adapter 提供 DE GPIO 和 setup/hold 预算。此配对属于调用者前置条件，不是运行时身份认证。实际 C11 ARM "
"消费工程保留了所选 UART/GPIO provider 与 adapter，但不建立物理总线时序。RS232 验收，以及图纸中的 "
"MAX485/MAX232 供电或实际替代器件，仍需验证。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:278
msgid ""
"The sensor wire profiles are explicit software references. DS18B20 support "
"requires external VDD and a pull-up; parasite power and a strong pull-up are "
"not inferred. Infrared decoding separates strict edge sources from an "
"explicitly selected IRQ-observation reference. The latter preserves source "
"flags and marks its result sampled/uncertain; it cannot attest complete "
"hardware edge capture. The actual remote protocol and fitted audio/camera "
"modules remain unconfirmed."
msgstr ""
"传感器接线配置是显式的软件参考。DS18B20 要求外部 VDD 和上拉，不推导寄生供电或强上拉。红外解码区分严格边沿来源与另行显式选择的 IRQ "
"观测参考；后者保留来源标志，并将结果标为采样/不确定，不能证明硬件边沿捕获完整。实际遥控协议及已装音频/摄像头模块仍未确认。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:285
msgid "Legal combinations and evidence"
msgstr "合法组合与证据"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:287
msgid ""
"Complete Board support is a set of reviewed configurations, not one assembly "
"with every peripheral enabled. V4.1 Ethernet MDIO and the standard RS485 "
"route share PA2. USB FS/CAN1, CAN2/audio, SDIO/camera/UART5 and "
"UART6/camera/audio also have real pad conflicts. A software choice cannot "
"replace physical rewiring. Different DMA channel numbers do not permit "
"simultaneous use of one DMA Stream. The selected profile must reserve clocks,"
" vectors, timers and memory domains as well as pins."
msgstr ""
"完整开发板支持是一组已审配置，并非将所有外设同时启用的一份装配。V4.1 的以太网 MDIO 与标准 RS485 路由共用 PA2；USB "
"FS/CAN1、CAN2/音频、SDIO/摄像头/UART5 和 UART6/摄像头/音频也存在真实引脚冲突。软件选择不能代替物理改线。不同 DMA "
"channel 编号不能同时使用同一 DMA Stream。选定配置除引脚外，还必须保留时钟、中断向量、定时器及内存域。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:295
msgid ""
"RGB565 QVGA uses 153600 bytes per frame, already exceeding 128 KiB main SRAM."
" RGB565 VGA double buffering uses 1228800 bytes, exceeding the drawn 1 MiB "
"SRAM. Memory format, frame rate, buffer count and bus bandwidth therefore "
"belong in the explicit composition budget. The separate 64 KiB CCM is CPU-"
"only for these DMA paths. Measured linked costs, throughput and electrical "
"timing remain separate evidence scopes."
msgstr ""
"RGB565 QVGA 每帧占 153600 字节，已超过 128 KiB 主 SRAM。RGB565 VGA 双缓冲占 1228800 "
"字节，超过图纸中的 1 MiB SRAM。因此，内存格式、帧率、缓冲数量和总线带宽属于显式装配预算。独立 64 KiB CCM 对这些 DMA 路径仅供 "
"CPU 使用。实测链接成本、吞吐率和电气时序仍分别建立证据。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:302
msgid ""
"Implementation proceeds through exact facts and minimal startup, electrical "
"and controller admission, reusable device components, FSMC/SDIO/media modes, "
"then legal external examples and frozen integration. Each behavioral change "
"retains genuine RED before implementation, GREEN and independent review. "
"Final ARM, installed SDK, resource and bilingual checks bind their exact "
"source and configuration; a focused model pass does not close the whole Board"
" exit."
msgstr ""
"实施依次完成精确事实与最小启动、电气和控制器准入、通用器件组件、FSMC/SDIO/介质模式，随后完成合法的外部示例与冻结集成。每项行为变更保留实现前真实"
" RED、GREEN 和独立评审。最终 ARM、安装后 SDK、资源和双语检查绑定精确源码与配置；定向模型通过不能关闭整板退出条件。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:309
msgid ""
"The initial FSMC C draft preceded a runnable behavioral RED test. The "
"original draft and failed harness attempts are retained; later genuine "
"failure-path regressions and GREEN executions keep their actual chronology. "
"This exception does not meet the project's strict TDD ordering requirement "
"for that draft. QB30 must retain the exception and its independent-review "
"responsibility rather than reconstructing an earlier RED or claiming full "
"process compliance."
msgstr ""
"最初的 FSMC C 草稿早于可运行的行为 RED 测试。原始草稿及失败的工装尝试均保留；后续真实失败路径回归和 GREEN "
"执行保持实际时间顺序。该草稿不满足项目严格的 TDD 顺序要求。QB30 必须保留此例外及其独立评审责任，不能重构出更早的 "
"RED，也不能宣称完全符合流程。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:316
msgid ""
"The initial `SystemInit` SRAM-hook draft has a second ordering exception: its"
" first host fixture had a mapping conflict, so the later before-image "
"comparison is retrospective. The early compiler-generated `memset` failure "
"also lacks an exact contemporary source snapshot. Later genuine defect "
"regressions and the five accepted freestanding ARM captures retain their own "
"exact source and execution identities; they do not repair those earlier "
"evidence gaps."
msgstr ""
"最初的 `SystemInit` SRAM "
"钩子草稿还存在第二个顺序例外：其首个主机夹具有地址映射冲突，因此后来的修改前镜像比较属于追溯分析。早期编译器生成的 `memset` "
"失败也缺少精确的同时点源码快照。后续真实缺陷回归与五种已接受的 freestanding ARM 采集分别保留其源码和执行身份，不能修补此前的证据缺口。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:323
msgid ""
"HIL admission must bind physical PCB, part population, jumpers, connector "
"path and the selected hardware/configuration digest. V4.1 transceiver "
"supply/part markings, PHY oscillator frequency and the inconsistent MDIO net "
"label require inspection. Prepared station tooling does not turn disconnected"
" hardware into a passed result. Original schematic files are not "
"automatically redistributed by adding their identities to the public Board "
"facts."
msgstr ""
"HIL 准入必须绑定实际 PCB、器件安装、跳线、连接器路径，以及所选硬件/配置摘要。V4.1 的收发器供电和器件标识、PHY 振荡器频率、MDIO "
"网络名不一致均须实物检查。准备好站点工装不能将未连接硬件改为通过。将原理图身份加入公开 Board 事实，不表示自动再分发原始原理图文件。"
